# Pairs with FrontierCoversCaptured. The #3758 defect: a full capture takes
# its cut from the registry-snapshot anchor alone, which production always
# records as zero, so every full backup is stamped at HLC 0 below the writes
# it holds, and the first increment on it drains with no WAL pin.
MODULE: FrontierCoversCapturedRegistryAnchorOnly
TARGET: FrontierCoversCaptured
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a full capture's cut is the zero registry anchor, not the captured high-water (#3758)
PERTURBS: CaptureFull

--- FIND
                       cut |-> IF 0 > HighHlc(I) THEN 0 ELSE HighHlc(I),
--- REPLACE
                       \* MUTATION: the anchor alone.
                       cut |-> 0,
--- END
